        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lauri Markkanen, Jimmy Butler, Pekka Markkanen, Eero Markkanen\n- Organizations: Minnesota Timberwolves, Chicago Bulls, AIK, Tyler Junior College, Marquette University, NBA\n- Roles: shooting guard, swing man, wing player\n\nFacts:\n- Jimmy Butler III was born on September 14, 1989.\n- Jimmy Butler was born in Houston, grew up in Tomball, Texas, and played college basketball for Tyler Junior College and Marquette University.\n- In the 2017 NBA draft, the Minnesota Timberwolves selected Lauri Markkanen with the 7th overall pick.\n- After the 2017 NBA draft, Lauri Markkanen was included in a trade from the Minnesota Timberwolves to the Chicago Bulls for Jimmy Butler.\n- Jimmy Butler is an American professional basketball player for the Minnesota Timberwolves of the National Basketball Association.\n- Pekka Markkanen is the father of Chicago Bulls basketball player Lauri Markkanen and AIK football player Eero Markkanen.\n- Jimmy Butler is listed among notable swing men, also called wing players, in the shooting guard role.",
